### Enroll student
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v2/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseCode": "CSE-101"
}

###

### Get student schedule
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v2/enrollments/1/schedule
Accept: application/json

###

### Create student
POST http://localhost:5000/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "registrationNumber": "STU-001",
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Kebede",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "gpa": 3.8
}

###

### Get students
GET http://localhost:5000/api/students?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Create course
POST http://localhost:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CSE-101",
  "title": "Introduction to Computer Science",
  "maxCapacity": 30
}

###

### Get courses
GET http://localhost:5000/api/courses?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Test deferred query
GET http://localhost:5000/api/test/deferred
Accept: application/json

###

### Test translation fail query
GET http://localhost:5000/api/test/translation-fail
Accept: application/json
